OL,3,GNEWSAVictim family's 'disbelief' at
OL,4,Arelease of killer who is now on the run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of a man whose killer has
OL,7,Fbeen on the run for eight days has said
OL,8,Fher family had no idea he had been
OL,9,Freleased from prison to attend his
OL,10,Ffather's funeral until after he
OL,11,Fabsconded.
OL,13,FGary Anderson and his brother Sean were
OL,14,Fjailed for life in 2023 for the murder
OL,15,Fof Karol Kelly in Londonderry in 2018.
OL,17,FAnderson was freed from Maghaberry
OL,18,Fprison for two hours last Monday after
OL,19,Fa court sitting the previous day
OL,20,Foverturned a decision by the Northern
OL,21,FIreland Prison Service (NIPS) not to
OL,22,Frelease him.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
